# Instructions for spotify
1. Install `spotify` with flatpak
'flatpak install flathub com.spotify.Client'

2. Log into spotify.

3- Install spicetify = curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spicetify/cli/main/install.sh | sh

If an error appears about not finding the prefs file. the file is in this path = '~/.var/app/com.spotify.Client/config/spotify/prefs'

Copy the path and paste it into = 'home/gidsd/.config/spicetify/config-xpui.ini'

try again the same command and hope for get correct

4- Drop spicetify.ini into = '~/config/matugen/templates/'

5- Edit '~/.config/matugen/config.toml'

[templates.spicetify]
input_path = '~/.config/matugen/templates/spicetify.ini'
output_path = '~/.config/spicetify/Themes/caelestia/color.ini'
post_hook = '~/.config/matugen/scripts/spiceitfy_theme_apply.sh'

6- Drop user.css into '~/.config/spicetify/Themes/caelestia/user.css'

7- exec 'spicetify config current_theme caelestia'
then: spicetify apply

